# clause 2, the update path of the scratch launcher <S>/fbin/fusion
launcher, as written by the tag's install.sh:
4:FUSION_DIR="<S>/fhome"
7:    curl -fsSL "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tenzoki/fusion/main/install.sh" -o /tmp/fusion-install.sh       && bash /tmp/fusion-install.sh
-> FUSION_DIR is baked in for a run and for --where; --update downloads main's install.sh to /tmp/fusion-install.sh and runs it with the caller's environment, passing neither FUSION_DIR nor the launcher's own directory

